ried about  sensing that something is wrong kaise  tries to call legion but no one answers  the call  the following day he is called by legion  saying that he is sorry and he will do  anything to make it up if he has the  chance this call makes kaiser really  upset and worried he visits the real  estate agency where his friend works  only to discover that lee joon has been  fired two months ago because of the same  reason deceiving his client and then  vanishing after that he is taken by the  same mysterious guide to anderson who  turns out to be kaise's depth owner he  is equipped with a device that can  translate their conversation into their  own language anderson reveals that  legion lost all the money for gambling  in macau and won't be able to pay the  debt thus all the debt will be accounted  to kaise to pay off the interest on the  astronomical debt he has incurred the  businessman offers him to participate in  a game conducted at a cruise ship called  destiny he adds that all kissy's loan  will be cleared if he manages to win the  game but has to face the consequences if  eliminated  before he leaves kaisi confronts king  saying that he will leave for a business  trip and tell her to unhook his mom from  the respirator if he doesn't come back  in a week  kaisi is then gathered with other  participants in a room where they will  be injected with an anesthetic before  they are delivered to the ship  before being injected he suddenly starts  hallucinating again visualizing himself  escaping from that place by using the  stolen car while being chased by the  guards  back to the real world he attempts to  escape using the same method but he  fails what a poor guy  kissy wakes up and finds himself branded  with a number along with other  participants who will play against him  in the game set in the old-fashioned  ballroom of a huge ship as it sails  through the seas by ninth  all players are provided with 12 cards  concerning the images of rock scissors  or pape