nent to play with  on the other side kaise also borrows  money from the loan to buy a star after  spotting the right man and doing an  in-depth analysis about the cards he  might have they challenged him to play  and manage to win 3 stars from him  suddenly a player is eliminated from the  game because he was caught throwing away  the cards into the toilet causing  anderson to shoot him to death after the  incident the team begins to plan a new  strategy because time is ticking and the  cards keep decreasing legion urges the  team to spend the money on cards and fat  man questions him regarding which cards  will guarantee their survival after  analyzing the circumstances kaiser  realizes that paper cards are the fewest  in the game right now and caesar's cards  are the most by assuming that the cards  will decrease at the same and linear  rate paper cards will be the first to  run out because of that kaiser suggests  the team to stock up the rock cards  because they will never lose  long story short they manage to buy all  the rock cards from other players and  wait until the time is right but their  prediction is wrong as paper cards  haven't been decreasing for a while and  scissor cards are dropping fast they  realize that someone is also stocking up  the cards like they do  other team members start panicking and  fatman and legion decides to play the  cards and end up losing and giving away  their stars  a few moments later they are confronted  by luka and his team members  turns out that luca has been monitoring  their movements since kaisi borrowed  money and figured out their strategy  also luka's team members are the one who  beat fat man and lee jun  after negotiating for a while because  time is running out kaisi challenges  luca by betting his three stars and all  the team money for lucas star in one  game  the game begins and it turns out that  kaiser realizes luca has an odd total  number of his cards meaning that he must  throw away the extra card beca