s  been deceived by white suited man and is  looking for him  unfortunately the white suited man has  won the game and leaves the old man  alone in the black room the game is  finally over and the players have the  chance to redeem the stars for money or  to help their friends surprisingly  fighting men refuses to help kaiser and  takes all the stars from legion he also  reveals that he was lying about his  daughter and his mom earlier  he then leaves a bag of money to legion  and goes away  as expected legion also acts like an  animal and eventually betrays kaiser  which makes him furious  kaisi spots something being hidden on  the back of a player and starts  attacking him turns out that he manages  to steal a diamond from the player's  back and other players are forced to  release kaise from the black room before  he leaves the old man begs him to send a  message to his son  after being released kaiser immediately  confronts fatty men and launches his  final punches towards him forcing him to  hand over all the stars and money  kaisi then exchanges all the stars to  release the old man because he knows  what it feels to live without a dad and  telling him to tell the message himself  to his son  finally all the winners are released  from the ship and go back to their daily  life  kaiser returns to king and both of them  reunite again at the end of the movie  kaiser discovers that anderson is the  one who broke into their house several  years ago and his father has also  participated in the game  subscribe to watch more videos like this  turn on notifications and leave a like  to help the channel out  thank you for watching

